..)","كَبِيرٌ ← أَكْبَرُ / عَلِيمٌ ← أَعْلَمُ / صَادِقٌ ← أَصْدَقُ","Sabse bada / Sabse zyada jaanne wala / Sabse zyada sachcha"],["Mazeed أَفْعَلُ Alfaaz","أَظْلَمُ / أَحْسَنُ / أَقْرَبُ / أَشَدُّ / أَهْدَىٰ","Sabse bada zaalim / Sabse behtar / Zyada qareeb / Zyada sakht / Zyada hidayat par"],["خَيْرٌ aur شَرٌّ (Bina أَ ke Tafzeel)","وَالْآخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ وَأَبْقَىٰ / شَرُّ الدَّوَابِّ","Aur aakhirat behtar aur zyada baqi rehne wali hai / Bad-tareen jaandaar"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l19_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 19</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Ism-ut-Tafzeel (Sabse / Zyada): كَبِيرٌ ← أَكْبَرُ ، عَلِيمٌ ← أَعْلَمُ (Page 50)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كَبِيرٌ ، عَلِيمٌ ، ظَالِمٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Ism-ut-Tafzeel (أَفْعَلُ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">أَكْبَرُ ، أَعْلَمُ ، أَظْلَمُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كَبِيرٌ ، عَلِيمٌ ، ظَالِمٌ (Bada, Jaanne wala, Zaalim) → أَكْبَرُ ، أَعْلَمُ ، أَظْلَمُ (Sabse bada / zyada bada, Sabse zyada jaanne wala, Sabse bada zaalim).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 50):** Kisi sifat mein muwazana (**'zyada ...' ya 'sabse ...'**) paida karne ke liye 3-harfi maadde se pehle **`أَ`** lagaya jata hai (**`أَفْعَلُ`** wazan), aur is par Tanween nahin aati (sirf ek Pesh `ـُ` aata hai): `كَبِيرٌ ← أَكْبَرُ` (sabse bada), `عَلِيمٌ ← أَعْلَمُ` (sabse zyada jaanne wala), `حَسَنٌ ← أَحْسَنُ` (sabse behtar). Do alfaaz `خَيْرٌ` (behtar) aur `شَرٌّ` (bad-tar) baghair `أَ` ke isi ma'ni mein aate hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l19_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail alfaaz par ghaur karein, unki banawat aur ma'ani ko dekhein:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l19_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar diye gaye alfaaz mein chand baatein mushtarak (ek jaisi) hain: Har lafz chaar huroof par mushtamil hai, har lafz ke shuru mein (أَ) hai, aur sab par aaraab (harakat) ek jaise hain. Arabi mein iss wazan (أَفْعَلُ) par aane wale alfaaz Ism-e-Tafzeel (Superlative) hote hain, jin mein kisi sift ki inteha ya sabse zyada hone ka ma'ana paida hota hai. Yeh alfaaz logon ke naamon ke taur par bhi aam istemal hote hain, jaise Akram (sabse ba-izzat) ya Afzal (sabse behtar)."}},{"id":"sec_s1l19_lbl4","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Ab aap darj zail alfaaz ko khud samajh sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l19_g5","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l19_g5_w1","arabic":"أَعْلَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عْلَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada jaanne wala","translations":{"en":"Best knowing / Most knowledgeable","ur":"سب سے زیادہ جاننے والا","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा जानने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w2","arabic":"أَصْغَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">صْغَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse chhota","translations":{"en":"Smallest / Smaller","ur":"سب سے چھوٹا","hi":"सबसे छोटा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w3","arabic":"أَكْبَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كْبَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse bada","translations":{"en":"Greatest / Greater","ur":"سب سے بڑا","hi":"सबसे बड़ा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w4","arabic":"أَحْسَنُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حْسَنُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse achha","translations":{"en":"Best / Most beautiful","ur":"سب سے اچھا","hi":"सबसे अच्छा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w5","arabic":"أَظْلَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">ظْلَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse bada zalim","translations":{"en":"Most unjust / Greatest wrongdoer","ur":"سب سے بڑا ظالم","hi":"सबसे बड़ा ज़ालिम"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w6","arabic":"أَرْحَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">رْحَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada meharban","translations":{"en":"Most Merciful","ur":"سب سے زیادہ مہربان","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा मेहरबान"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w7","arabic":"أَصْدَقُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">صْدَقُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse sachha","translations":{"en":"Most truthful","ur":"سب سے سچا","hi":"सबसे सच्चा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w8","arabic":"أَعْلَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عْلَى</span>","hinglish":"Sabse buland","translations":{"en":"Most high / Highest","ur":"سب سے بلند","hi":"सबसे बुलंद"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w9","arabic":"أَقْرَبُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قْرَبُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse qareeb","translations":{"en":"Nearest / Closest","ur":"سب سے قریب","hi":"सबसे क़रीब"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w10","arabic":"أَهْدَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">هْدَى</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada hidayat yafta","translations":{"en":"Better guided / Most guided","ur":"سب سے زیادہ ہدایت یافتہ","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा हिदायत याफ़्ता"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w11","arabic":"أَزْكَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">زْكَى</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada pakizah","translations":{"en":"Purest / Most upright","ur":"سب سے زیادہ پاکیزہ","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा पाकीज़ा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w12","arabic":"أَطْهَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">طْهَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada paak","translations":{"en":"Cleaner / Most pure","ur":"سب سے زیادہ پاک","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा पाक"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w13","arabic":"أَقْوَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قْوَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada seedha","translations":{"en":"Most upright / Straightest","ur":"سب سے زیادہ سیدھا","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा सीधा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w14","arabic":"أَبْقَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">بْقَى</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada baaqi rehne wala","translations":{"en":"Most enduring / Everlasting","ur":"سب سے زیادہ باقی رہنے والا","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा बाक़ी रहने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w15","arabic":"أَحْكَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حْكَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada hikmat wala","translations":{"en":"Most Just / Wisest","ur":"سب سے زیادہ حکمت والا","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा हिकमत वाला"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w16","arabic":"أَوَّلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَّلُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse pehla","translations":{"en":"First / Foremost","ur":"سب سے پہلا","hi":"सबसे पहला"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w17","arabic":"أَدْنَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">دْنَى</span>","hinglish":"Sabse qareeb / sabse kamtar","translations":{"en":"Closer / Less / Inferior","ur":"سب سے قریب / سب سے کمتر","hi":"सबसे क़रीब / सबसे कमतर"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w18","arabic":"أَسْفَلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">سْفَلُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse neecha","translations":{"en":"Lowest","ur":"سب سے نیچا","hi":"सबसे नीचा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w19","arabic":"أَخْسَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">خْسَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada nuqsaan mein","translations":{"en":"Greatest losers / Most in loss","ur":"سب سے زیادہ نقصان میں","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा नुक़सान में"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w20","arabic":"أَضَلُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">ضَلُّ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada bhatka hua","translations":{"en":"Most astray / Furthest astray","ur":"سب سے زیادہ بھٹکا ہوا","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा भटका हुआ"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w21","arabic":"أَكْثَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كْثَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada","translations":{"en":"Most / Greater in number","ur":"سب سے زیادہ","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w22","arabic":"أَحَقُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَقُّ</span>","hinglish":"Sabse zyada haqdar","translations":{"en":"Having greater right / Most entitled","ur":"سب سے زیادہ حقدار","hi":"सबसे ज़्यादा हक़दार"}},{"id":"s1l19_g5_w23","arabic":"أَذَلُّ","a